1
00:00:01,910 --> 00:00:06,350
The Marketplace tab is a library of ready-made trading strategies.

2
00:00:06,450 --> 00:00:10,520
Each card shows the strategy's name, its author and what it does.

3
00:00:10,620 --> 00:00:14,190
The supplied strategies come from ActTrader, marked with a tick.

4
00:00:14,290 --> 00:00:17,550
Free strategies cost nothing.

5
00:00:17,650 --> 00:00:23,180
Others show a price to rent each month or to buy.

6
00:00:23,280 --> 00:00:31,170
Pick a category to see only that kind of strategy.

7
00:00:31,270 --> 00:00:38,510
Or type part of a name to search.

8
00:00:38,610 --> 00:00:43,940
Click an author to see only their strategies.

9
00:00:44,040 --> 00:00:49,060
The cross clears the author filter.

10
00:00:49,160 --> 00:00:53,920
Click a card to open its details: summary, category, tags and price.

11
00:00:54,020 --> 00:01:02,160
Add to My Strategies puts your own copy in ActFX, ready to run or test.

12
00:01:02,260 --> 00:01:08,080
The star on a card marks a favourite. Favourites shows only those.

13
00:01:08,180 --> 00:01:14,200
Purchased lists the strategies you have bought, rented or are trying for free.

14
00:01:14,300 --> 00:01:16,700
The count shows how many strategies are listed.

